      "analysis": "Target is Problem D. The supplied implementation uses full n-by-n traversal with rolling rows, despite sparse blocked cells and n<200000; its measured valid baseline mean is 0.0798407 s on this run. Main research split is sparse combinatorial inclusion-exclusion, dense/parallel DP, and a rigorously chosen hybrid. All approaches must remain exact modulo 1,000,000,007 for every permitted input."
